If we look at who is extracting the most out of the two most explosive personnel groupings an intersting story emerges. McVay has a very tight distribution and much tighter HDI's for 11 personnel while Andy Reid has a much higher median and wider distribution. We see a similar trend emerge with 21 personnel with Shanahan and Payton albeit the difference is much more muted between the two play callers. 


